  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Krali\xE7esi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nOrtaya koydu\u011Fun \xE7aba ve etti\u011Fin dualar, seni her konuda
    zirveye \xE7ok yakla\u015Ft\u0131rm\u0131\u015F {{isim}}. Hay\u0131rl\u0131 olmayanlar
    hari\xE7, pek \xE7ok \u015Fey g\xF6nl\xFCne g\xF6re olmu\u015F. Tarafs\u0131z
    de\u011Ferlendirmek gerekirse, bug\xFCne dek olduk\xE7a huzurlu ve verimli bir
    ya\u015Fam s\xFCrd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC s\xF6ylemek m\xFCmk\xFCn. Maddi kaynaklar\u0131n\u0131
    ve enerjini do\u011Fru yerlere kanalize etmi\u015F ve ak\u0131ll\u0131ca davranm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    \u0130nsanlarla olan ba\u015Far\u0131l\u0131 ileti\u015Fimin ve yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    g\xFCzel i\u015Fler, karizman\u0131n ve prestijinin artmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flam\u0131\u015F.
    Gelece\u011Fini g\xFCvence alt\u0131na alabilmek i\xE7in hi\xE7bir a\xE7\u0131k
    kap\u0131 b\u0131rakmam\u0131\u015F, sorun yaratabilecek herkese g\xF6nl\xFCn\xFC
    kitlemi\u015Fsin."
